OL,3,GNEWSAMan who left dogs without water
OL,4,Agiven 10-year ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been banned from owning
OL,7,Fanimals for 10 years after he was found
OL,8,Fguilty of mistreating two Cane Corso
OL,9,Fdogs who were left without water on
OL,10,Fderelict land.
OL,12,FVenode Kumar Mohan, 49, had control of
OL,13,Fland between Cherwell Close and London
OL,14,FRoad, in Slough, when one of the dogs
OL,15,Fstrayed from it into a garden on 12
OL,16,FJune 2025.
OL,18,FSlough Council's animal welfare
OL,19,Finspector visited and found the second
OL,20,Fdog at the site.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
