OL,3,GNEWSAMan who left dogs without water
OL,4,Agiven 10-year ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FMohan, from the Berkshire town, was
OL,7,Ffound guilty of animal cruelty offences
OL,8,Fin his absence at Slough Magistrates'
OL,9,FCourt in September. He was told to
OL,10,Fcomplete 300 hours of unpaid work and
OL,11,Ffined #364 on 6 November.
